&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Sr. Product Manager&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #434343;&quot;&gt;This role is focused on leading core, user-facing and backend system software initiatives which are critical to the success of the PlayStation platform. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #434343;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a motivated Product Manager who can work with multiple international teams to define the customer experience, workflows, and important metrics &amp;amp; features to support this foundational part of our business.&amp;nbsp; T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #434343;&quot;&gt;he ideal candidate has at least 5 years experience managing and releasing consumer software products and can work cross functionally and cross platform (PC/Mobile/Console). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;This role will include working closely with internal collaborators and development partners to define and implement the strategic roadmap, and build exemplary product experiences end to end. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;This position follows a hybrid work model, combining remote work with in-office collaboration. Occasional onsite presence is expected for key activities such as team building, collaborative sessions, and workshops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #434343;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead User Experience for PlayStation platform core experience features, products and services, by developing requirements working with stakeholders across the global business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Maintain and communicate the roadmap for the products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Prioritize features based on product strategy and global business objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Ensure features are backed by important metrics and that success is measured on a regular basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Act as Voice of Customer (VoC) to create the strategic vision for platform features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Understand and communicate how your product is used in market, based on customer feedback, research and data, feeding back into future requirements and product roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Understand and communicate the competitive landscape as it affects PlayStation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Articulate business and consumer rationale to the teams building the product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work closely with design teams to design experience that are usable, feasible, viable, and consistent as Platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work closely with engineering teams to ensure we build the right product and ship it at the right time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Work closely with Program Management team as they supervise delivery, lead timelines, and resolve blockers/risks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn &amp;amp; Improve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #0e0e0e;&quot;&gt;Continually stay ahead of industry trends, player behavior insights, and emerging technologies to refine your product strategy and vision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #434343;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;BA/BS Degree or equivalent preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;5+ years experience as a Product Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Self-motivated, outcome-driven and proactive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Innovativeness while collaborating on new products, solutions, and features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Ability to travel domestic and international when safely able to do so (-15%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Passion for games and gaming industry trends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #434343;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Experience in building and shipping technical consumer products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing complex product areas with multiple organizational stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Strong ability to facilitate &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional communication and decision-making&lt;/strong&gt; (Product, Design, Engineering, Business)&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;balancing customer needs, business priorities, and technical feasibility&lt;/strong&gt; in a fast-paced development environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Comfortable making critical product decisions in collaboration with senior leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive mindset&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to drive forward discussions, especially in ambiguous or challenging situations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High ownership and persistence&lt;/strong&gt; – someone who can push through obstacles and deliver outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal and interpersonal skills - You will be interacting with all types of people (user experience designers, engineers, managers, vendors, partners, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Worked in an agile/scrum development environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with testing/experimentation and other various methodologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Nice to have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Experience with Atlassian software suite (JIRA/Confluence)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with telework meetings and tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Experience shipping at least 3 consumer electronics product or features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Experience in Gaming industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #202124 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #202124;&quot;&gt;Experience working with international teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;is eligible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$253,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
